    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Chief Minister Sindh, Syed Qaim Ali Shah, said that nurses can \"provide the creative and innovative solutions\" that can not only improve the health of their patients, but also provide solutions that can help in the development of health systems in communities and hospitals. He spoke at a seminar celebrating International Nurses Day at Aga Khan University.",
